# 📈 Sales Prediction Using Python

## 📌 Project Overview

This project develops a Machine Learning Regression model to predict product sales based on advertising expenditures across different media channels such as TV, Radio, and Newspaper.

The project demonstrates the complete data science workflow including data preprocessing, exploratory data analysis (EDA), feature engineering, model training, evaluation, and prediction.

---

## 📂 Dataset

Dataset: advertising.csv

Typical Features:

- TV Advertising Budget
- Radio Advertising Budget
- Newspaper Advertising Budget
- Sales (Target Variable)

---

## 🎯 Objective

To predict product sales using advertising expenditure and help businesses make data-driven marketing decisions.

